<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Goa cargoes - Feb 13.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Goa cargoes - Feb 13.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Marmagao port on February 13:</p>
<p> Commodity		Tons		   Ship	    Berthing</p>
<p>		    (LDD/ULD)(Balance)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Iron Ore (Fines)  32,400 (LDD)  9,850    Amber Halo     12/02</p>
<p>Met Coke	     1,310 (LDD) 20,690    Bugaz	    12/02</p>
<p>Coke		   3,934 (ULD)     60    Asean Pioneer  05/02</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>		  Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co,Goa)</p>
